    "Pins the sensor to channel %lld and streams the frames it hears into a .pcap for Wireshark. Bluetooth is narrow, so this is a short, thinned sample — not a full capture — and it stops on its own near %lld frames.": {
      "comment": "A description of how the app captures traffic from a sensor.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Pins the sensor to channel %1$lld and streams the frames it hears into a .pcap for Wireshark. Bluetooth is narrow, so this is a short, thinned sample — not a full capture — and it stops on its own near %2$lld frames."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Сенсор встаёт на канал %lld и передаёт услышанные кадры в .pcap для Wireshark. Bluetooth — узкий канал, поэтому это короткая прореженная выборка, а не полный захват; запись сама остановится около %lld кадров."
          }
        }
      }
    },
